      {
        "props": {
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "title": "We can't wait to get to know you better, and we hope you'll apply to the University of San Francisco. In the meantime, we recommend taking a virtual tour or dropping by for a campus visit and meeting some of our students and staff who will support you when you get here. If you have any questions, don't hesitate to reach out to your admission counselor. We're here to help and can answer any questions, big or small.\n"
        },
        "id": "adcce480-95fd-428b-9bb7-419ca4dc7b6d",
        "type": "paragraph"
