      {
        "id": "02906e0b-1443-464f-89f3-c5c303229216",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "props": {
          "align": "left",
          "title": "The main campus of the University of San Francisco, \"the Hilltop\" is located in the geographic center of the city. Our hilltop campus is divided between two adjacent plots: Lone Mountain and lower campus. Spread across 55-acres, separated by Turk Street in San Francisco’s Inner Richmond neighborhood, the hilltop campus is home to five schools and a vibrant community of students inspired to change the world from here.\n",
          "style": "body"
        }
      },
      {
        "props": {
          "style": "h2",
          "align": "left",
          "title": "Life at USF"
        },
        "id": "6fc49fd3-8490-4307-b43d-9c0d5c7a3eb1",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "props": {
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "title": "Find your people in your residence hall. Find your fun in a club or in a club sport. Follow your passions with the help of mentors, professors, and peers who help you find, then reach, your goals. Start your next chapter on the Hilltop. "
        },
        "id": "e6a49725-93e4-4b53-9d2b-2adc3af52a88",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
