      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "id": "5697079a-fed2-4e14-8c28-9c00f9c1e8d3",
        "props": {
          "title": "Scholarship Opportunities",
          "style": "h2",
          "align": "left"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "id": "eee03bd0-e041-4766-946f-d76e2941b2fa",
        "props": {
          "title": "All first year and transfer applicants are automatically considered for merit scholarships.\n\nA note on financial aid: We encourage you to use our net price calculator to estimate the financial aid that may be available to you and the net cost of attendance for a new first-year or transfer undergraduate student. If you plan on applying for financial aid, familiarize yourself with the required financial aid forms. We'll need these completed forms in order to prepare a financial aid package for you. If you have any questions, you can email us at financialaid@usfca.edu.\n\nGo Dons!\n",
          "align": "left",
          "style": "body"
        },
        "canMove": true,
        "canDelete": true
